    "mcap_bn_vnd_vci": "Cross-check: Vietcap's own ICB aggregate (market-watch/AllocatedICB/getAllocated, ONE_DAY, totalMarketCap + totalPriceChange, summed over HOSE+HNX+UPCOM groups). Higher than mcap_bn_vnd for Banks (+138.7 tn) and Industrial Goods (+12.1 tn): Vietcap appears to count shares not yet on the board.",
    "ret_1m_pct": "Cap-weighted from constituents: Σ(listed shares × close 2026-10-30) ÷ Σ(listed shares × adjusted close on the last session on/before 2026-09-30) − 1; adjusted daily closes from Vietcap chart/OHLCChart/gap-chart; current share counts used for weights; stocks without a base close (new listings) excluded — see ret_coverage_pct (share of industry cap included).",
    "ret_ytd_pct": "As ret_1m_pct with base = last session of 2025 (2025-12-31).",
    "ret_1m_pct_vci / ret_ytd_pct_vci": "Cross-check: Vietcap's ICB change % (AllocatedICB, group ALL, timeFrames ONE_MONTH / YTD; cap-weighted Σ price change ÷ Σ base cap). Vietcap does not document the ONE_MONTH base date; its ICB figures are within ~3 pp of ret_* for every industry.",
    "foreign_own_pct": "≈ derived, not an ownership disclosure: Σ (totalRoom − currentRoom) × price ÷ Σ cap over constituents with foreign-room data on the Vietcap board (2026-10-30). Room data can lag corporate actions. Null when room data cover < 50% of industry cap (foreign_coverage_pct).",
    "top": "3 largest constituents by mcap_bn_vnd; ret_ytd_pct per stock = adjusted close 2026-10-30 ÷ 2025-12-31 − 1 (null for 2026 listings).",
